@startuml
autonumber

title US203 - View Compatible Routes — Simplified Sequence Diagram
actor "Air Transport Company Collaborator (ATCC)" as ATCC
participant ":System" as Sys

ATCC -> Sys: Requests compatible routes for a specific aircraft \n(provides registration number)
Sys --> ATCC: Displays a list of compatible routes based on the aircraft's range and capacity

@enduml